{"seq":1,"slug":"window-manager-selection","title":"窗口管理器选型与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/window-manager-selection","wordCount":862,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"窗口管理器选型与配置\">窗口管理器选型与配置</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>macOS 原生的窗口管理体验——手动拖拽调整大小、Mission Control 切换桌面——对于需要同时操作终端、编辑器、浏览器、文档的开发者来说效率不足。平铺式窗口管理器（Tiling Window Manager）通过自动化布局和键盘驱动操作，将窗口管理从&quot;鼠标操作&quot;转变为&quot;意念到达&quot;。2026 年 macOS 平台上有多款成熟方案可选，各有哲学和适用场景。</p>\n<p>本文对比主流窗口管理方案，提供选型决策框架和核心配置实战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"窗口管理范式\">窗口管理范式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n<th>理念</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动平铺</td>\n<td>macOS 原生、Magnet</td>\n<td>用户主动触发布局，简单直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动平铺</td>\n<td>Aerospace、yabai</td>\n<td>窗口自动填充空间，类 i3wm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能启动器集成</td>\n<td>Raycast</td>\n<td>窗口管理作为启动器的附加能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚本驱动</td>\n<td>Hammerspoon</td>\n<td>完全可编程，无限灵活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型决策\">选型决策</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;你的需求是什么?&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;想要完全自动平铺?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C{&quot;需要稳定且免配置?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| D[&quot;Aerospace&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;否,追求极致定制&quot;| E[&quot;yabai + skhd&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否,偶尔调整即可&quot;| F{&quot;已经在用 Raycast?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G[&quot;Raycast Window Management&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| H[&quot;Amethyst 或 Hammerspoon&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"你的需求是什么?\"] --&gt; B{\"想要完全自动平铺?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"是\"| C{\"需要稳定且免配置?\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"是\"| D[\"Aerospace\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"否,追求极致定制\"| E[\"yabai + skhd\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"否,偶尔调整即可\"| F{\"已经在用 Raycast?\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"是\"| G[\"Raycast Window Management\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"否\"| H[\"Amethyst 或 Hammerspoon\"]</pre><h3 id=\"核心术语\">核心术语</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Workspace/Space</strong>：虚拟桌面，每个空间包含一组窗口</li>\n<li><strong>Layout</strong>：窗口排列算法（tall、wide、grid、stack 等）</li>\n<li><strong>Focus</strong>：当前活动窗口</li>\n<li><strong>BSP (Binary Space Partition)</strong>：二叉空间分割，yabai 的默认布局算法</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"aerospace-配置\">Aerospace 配置</h3><p>Aerospace 是 2024 年发布的新一代 macOS 平铺窗口管理器，以稳定性和 Apple 生态兼容为设计目标，不需要关闭 SIP：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;brew install --cask aerospace\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cask</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aerospace</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置文件 <code>~/.aerospace.toml</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.aerospace.toml&#10;&#10;# 启动时自动执行&#10;after-login-command = []&#10;after-startup-command = []&#10;&#10;# 主修饰键（Alt 键不与系统冲突）&#10;[mode.main.binding]&#10;# 焦点切换&#10;alt-h = &#39;focus left&#39;&#10;alt-j = &#39;focus down&#39;&#10;alt-k = &#39;focus up&#39;&#10;alt-l = &#39;focus right&#39;&#10;&#10;# 窗口移动&#10;alt-shift-h = &#39;move left&#39;&#10;alt-shift-j = &#39;move down&#39;&#10;alt-shift-k = &#39;move up&#39;&#10;alt-shift-l = &#39;move right&#39;&#10;&#10;# 工作区切换&#10;alt-1 = &#39;workspace 1&#39;&#10;alt-2 = &#39;workspace 2&#39;&#10;alt-3 = &#39;workspace 3&#39;&#10;alt-4 = &#39;workspace 4&#39;&#10;&#10;# 窗口移到其他工作区&#10;alt-shift-1 = &#39;move-node-to-workspace 1&#39;&#10;alt-shift-2 = &#39;move-node-to-workspace 2&#39;&#10;alt-shift-3 = &#39;move-node-to-workspace 3&#39;&#10;&#10;# 布局切换&#10;alt-slash = &#39;layout tiles horizontal vertical&#39;&#10;alt-comma = &#39;layout accordion horizontal vertical&#39;&#10;alt-f = &#39;fullscreen&#39;&#10;&#10;# 调整大小&#10;alt-shift-minus = &#39;resize smart -50&#39;&#10;alt-shift-equal = &#39;resize smart +50&#39;&#10;&#10;# === 窗口规则 ===&#10;[[on-window-detected]]&#10;if.app-id = &#39;com.apple.finder&#39;&#10;run = &#39;layout floating&#39;&#10;&#10;[[on-window-detected]]&#10;if.app-id = &#39;com.apple.systempreferences&#39;&#10;run = &#39;layout floating&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.aerospace.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 启动时自动执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>after-login-command = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>after-startup-command = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 主修饰键（Alt 键不与系统冲突）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[mode.main.binding]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 焦点切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-h = 'focus left'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-j = 'focus down'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-k = 'focus up'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-l = 'focus right'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 窗口移动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-h = 'move left'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-j = 'move down'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-k = 'move up'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-l = 'move right'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 工作区切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-1 = 'workspace 1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-2 = 'workspace 2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-3 = 'workspace 3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-4 = 'workspace 4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 窗口移到其他工作区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-1 = 'move-node-to-workspace 1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-2 = 'move-node-to-workspace 2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-3 = 'move-node-to-workspace 3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 布局切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-slash = 'layout tiles horizontal vertical'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-comma = 'layout accordion horizontal vertical'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-f = 'fullscreen'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 调整大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-minus = 'resize smart -50'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-equal = 'resize smart +50'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># === 窗口规则 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[on-window-detected]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if.app-id = 'com.apple.finder'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run = 'layout floating'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[on-window-detected]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if.app-id = 'com.apple.systempreferences'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run = 'layout floating'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"yabai-skhd-配置\">yabai + skhd 配置</h3><p>yabai 是功能最强大的 macOS 平铺管理器，但需要关闭 SIP 才能使用全部功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;brew install koekeishiya/formulae/yabai&#10;brew install koekeishiya/formulae/skhd&#10;&#10;# 启动服务&#10;yabai --start-service&#10;skhd --start-service\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> koekeishiya/formulae/yabai</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> koekeishiya/formulae/skhd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启动服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --start-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">skhd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --start-service</span></span></code></pre></div><p>yabai 配置 <code>~/.yabairc</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env bash&#10;# ~/.yabairc&#10;&#10;# 布局模式&#10;yabai -m config layout bsp&#10;&#10;# 窗口间距&#10;yabai -m config top_padding    8&#10;yabai -m config bottom_padding 8&#10;yabai -m config left_padding   8&#10;yabai -m config right_padding  8&#10;yabai -m config window_gap     8&#10;&#10;# 焦点跟随鼠标&#10;yabai -m config focus_follows_mouse autofocus&#10;&#10;# 窗口透明度&#10;yabai -m config window_opacity on&#10;yabai -m config active_window_opacity 1.0&#10;yabai -m config normal_window_opacity 0.95&#10;&#10;# 浮动窗口规则&#10;yabai -m rule --add app=&quot;System Preferences&quot; manage=off&#10;yabai -m rule --add app=&quot;Calculator&quot; manage=off&#10;yabai -m rule --add app=&quot;1Password&quot; manage=off&#10;yabai -m rule --add app=&quot;Finder&quot; title=&quot;Info&quot; manage=off\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.yabairc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 布局模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> layout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bsp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 窗口间距</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top_padding</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bottom_padding</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> left_padding</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">   8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> right_padding</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> window_gap</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">     8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 焦点跟随鼠标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> focus_follows_mouse</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> autofocus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 窗口透明度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> window_opacity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> on</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> active_window_opacity</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> normal_window_opacity</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.95</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 浮动窗口规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rule</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=\"System Preferences\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> manage=off</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rule</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=\"Calculator\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> manage=off</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rule</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=\"1Password\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> manage=off</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rule</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=\"Finder\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> title=\"Info\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> manage=off</span></span></code></pre></div><p>skhd 快捷键配置 <code>~/.skhdrc</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ~/.skhdrc&#10;&#10;# 焦点切换&#10;alt - h : yabai -m window --focus west&#10;alt - j : yabai -m window --focus south&#10;alt - k : yabai -m window --focus north&#10;alt - l : yabai -m window --focus east&#10;&#10;# 窗口交换位置&#10;shift + alt - h : yabai -m window --swap west&#10;shift + alt - l : yabai -m window --swap east&#10;&#10;# 工作区切换&#10;alt - 1 : yabai -m space --focus 1&#10;alt - 2 : yabai -m space --focus 2&#10;alt - 3 : yabai -m space --focus 3&#10;&#10;# 窗口移到其他工作区&#10;shift + alt - 1 : yabai -m window --space 1&#10;shift + alt - 2 : yabai -m window --space 2&#10;&#10;# 切换布局&#10;alt - e : yabai -m space --layout bsp&#10;alt - s : yabai -m space --layout stack&#10;&#10;# 全屏&#10;alt - f : yabai -m window --toggle zoom-fullscreen\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.skhdrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 焦点切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">alt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">