bai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> space</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --layout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 全屏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">alt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yabai</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> window</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --toggle</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zoom-fullscreen</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"raycast-窗口管理\">Raycast 窗口管理</h3><p>如果已经在用 Raycast 作为启动器，其内置窗口管理足够日常使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Raycast Settings &gt; Extensions &gt; Window Management&#10;&#10;推荐快捷键映射：&#10;- 左半屏：Ctrl+Option+←&#10;- 右半屏：Ctrl+Option+→&#10;- 最大化：Ctrl+Option+↑&#10;- 还原：Ctrl+Option+↓&#10;- 左上角：Ctrl+Option+U&#10;- 右上角：Ctrl+Option+I&#10;- 左下角：Ctrl+Option+J&#10;- 右下角：Ctrl+Option+K\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Raycast Settings > Extensions > Window Management</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>推荐快捷键映射：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 左半屏：Ctrl+Option+←</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 右半屏：Ctrl+Option+→</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 最大化：Ctrl+Option+↑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 还原：Ctrl+Option+↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 左上角：Ctrl+Option+U</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 右上角：Ctrl+Option+I</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 左下角：Ctrl+Option+J</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 右下角：Ctrl+Option+K</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"方案对比总结\">方案对比总结</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Aerospace</th>\n<th>yabai</th>\n<th>Raycast</th>\n<th>Amethyst</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要关闭 SIP</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>部分功能需要</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动平铺</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（SIP 相关）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制深度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护活跃度</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n<td>商业产品</td>\n<td>维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工作区规划建议\">工作区规划建议</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作区</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>编码</td>\n<td>Terminal + Editor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>浏览器</td>\n<td>Firefox/Chrome</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>通讯</td>\n<td>Slack/飞书</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>文档</td>\n<td>Notion/Obsidian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>媒体/杂项</td>\n<td>Music/Preview</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"渐进式采纳策略\">渐进式采纳策略</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>第一周</strong>：只使用焦点切换（Alt+HJKL）和工作区切换（Alt+1234）</li>\n<li><strong>第二周</strong>：添加窗口移动和布局切换</li>\n<li><strong>第三周</strong>：定义应用规则和浮动例外</li>\n<li><strong>之后</strong>：根据实际痛点持续微调</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"辅助工具\">辅助工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>配合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SketchyBar</td>\n<td>自定义状态栏</td>\n<td>替代原生菜单栏，显示工作区信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Borders</td>\n<td>窗口边框高亮</td>\n<td>明确识别当前聚焦窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spaceman</td>\n<td>显示当前空间编号</td>\n<td>菜单栏空间指示器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"配置文件在-dotfiles-中的位置\">配置文件在 dotfiles 中的位置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/dotfiles/&#10;├── aerospace/&#10;│   └── .aerospace.toml&#10;├── yabai/&#10;│   └── .yabairc&#10;├── skhd/&#10;│   └── .skhdrc&#10;└── sketchybar/&#10;    └── .config/sketchybar/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/dotfiles/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── aerospace/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .aerospace.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── yabai/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .yabairc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── skhd/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .skhdrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── sketchybar/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── .config/sketchybar/</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>窗口管理器的核心价值是将&quot;移动手到鼠标 → 瞄准窗口边缘 → 拖拽调整&quot;这个数秒的操作缩短为一个快捷键的瞬间完成。对于大多数 macOS 开发者，Aerospace 是 2026 年的最佳起点——不需要关闭 SIP、TOML 配置简洁、与系统兼容性好。当需求超过 Aerospace 的能力范围（如窗口透明度控制、复杂的显示器规则）时，再迁移到 yabai。关键原则是：先小范围使用（焦点切换和工作区）建立肌肉记忆，再逐步扩展快捷键体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"窗口管理器选型与配置","id":"窗口管理器选型与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口管理范式","id":"窗口管理范式"},{"level":3,"text":"选型决策","id":"选型决策"},{"level":3,"text":"核心术语","id":"核心术语"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"Aerospace 配置","id":"aerospace-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"yabai + skhd 配置","id":"yabai-skhd-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Raycast 窗口管理","id":"raycast-窗口管理"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"方案对比总结","id":"方案对比总结"},{"level":3,"text":"工作区规划建议","id":"工作区规划建议"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进式采纳策略","id":"渐进式采纳策略"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"辅助工具","id":"辅助工具"},{"level":3,"text":"配置文件在 dotfiles 中的位置","id":"配置文件在-dotfiles-中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"系统偏好与开发者调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/macos-dev-environment/system-preferences-dev-tuning"},"next":{"title":"快捷键体系设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/keyboard-shortcut-system-design"}}